ostic-only.\n\n## Readback Counts\n- Runtime gate rows: 3530\n- Text-only attemptable rows: 2672\n- Visual-required rows: 858\n- Visual blocked invalid rows: 853\n- SourceFigureAsset production index rows integrated: 25\n- Visual asset-ready rows: 5\n- Visual asset-ready rights-blocked rows: 5\n- Visual final student-display eligible rows: 0\n- Wave 1 rows rechecked: 858\n- Wave 1 remain blocked rows: 858\n- Candidate-only rows: 650\n- Fallback-only rows: 208\n- Newly eligible if all evidence exists rows: 0\n- Launch-ready / official-scoring / Phase B2 mutation rows: 0 / 0 / 0\n\n## Artifacts\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.readback.md\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.validator-result.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.v1.json\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.readback.md\n- artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.validator-result.json\n\n## Verification\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.test.js` (12 passed)\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.mjs --root . --generated-at 2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z --write`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.mjs --root . --generated-at 2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z --write`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-figureasset-runtime-readiness-gate.mjs --root . --check`\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-visual-wave1-runtime-readiness-delta.mjs --root . --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (post-commit: clean worktree, branch ownership warning only)\n\n## Commit\n- 0c9c3f5583755af8871b7775128e865f147440b6\n\n## Blockers\n- None for the scoped run